{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MechaLeague is a fast-paced online VR platformer that uses grab and pull locomotion, grapple hooks and air brakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but difficult to master, compete with other players on PC and mobile VR headsets and desktop to score the most points and fastest race times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.poster.avif?t=1760747527\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.webm?t=1760747527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.mp4?t=1760747527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Triple Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently the game has 2 game modes, Triple Trials and Custom Challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will then play a 3 round match consisting of randomised levels from a rotating pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds consists of races, orb grab and bomb tag games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.poster.avif?t=1760747527\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.webm?t=1760747527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.mp4?t=1760747527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a Triple Trials match you will earn XP which will unlock player cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise every part of your avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains both free cosmetics and premium cosmetics DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.poster.avif?t=1760747527\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.webm?t=1760747527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.mp4?t=1760747527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Play Triple Trials","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/420760/deee63588c0e5953fbbc1f89826cd892026f7cbc.jpg"},{"name":"Upload Custom Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/420760/e805117caddfd0b3b13ce8307066877f7c1f2ff4.jpg"},{"name":"Rate a Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/420760/c4e8532dc3c36d97d6741fbc2d4bfe68741b14eb.jpg"},{"name":"Tier 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/420760/0edc52a4f5a72e3414bea79b0693b4babaa5c57f.jpg"},{"name":"First steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/420760/751f265ad0916f6b9b745c6551002d567bbd63fc.jpg"},{"name":"New Threads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/420760/078eff4db8d6a26f4fe8